WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,440
I gritted my teeth again and exchanged 67 bottles of mineral water for the two much-needed gold coins.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,280
Gold coins are too expensive

3
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:08,280
If it weren’t for having a good night’s sleep with Uncle Jiang Lei tonight,

4
00:00:08,280 --> 00:00:09,840
I'm not willing to spend so much water

5
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:20,770
Reluctantly set aside one

6
00:00:20,770 --> 00:00:24,680
A one-person passageway that can walk from the door to the toilet is placed.

7
00:00:31,740 --> 00:00:33,580
Although not as good as my big insect

8
00:00:33,780 --> 00:00:38,580
But it’s so happy to be soft. It’s soft and elastic and not bad.

9
00:00:38,940 --> 00:00:40,180
Just not serious

10
00:00:43,510 --> 00:00:45,110
Holding a soft future

11
00:00:45,760 --> 00:00:47,400
This is called sleeping too soundly
